# Environment & Launch Pattern

Read before running any code in this repo.

## Environment

Dependencies are managed with `[SET AT SETUP: PACKAGE_MANAGER]`. All runs go
through it (no manual venv activation needed):

```bash
[SET AT SETUP: PACKAGE_MANAGER_SYNC_CMD]      # install/update the locked environment
[SET AT SETUP: PACKAGE_MANAGER_RUN_CMD] <command>   # run anything inside the managed env
```
